---

<section class="about section" id="about">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="mono-label section__eyebrow">
      <span>01</span>
      <span class="about__sep" aria-hidden="true">——</span>
      <span>About</span>
    </p>

    <h2 class="section__title">
      A venture builder and product operator,
      <em class="serif-italic">based in London.</em>
    </h2>

    <div class="about__body">
      <p>
        I have 10 years of experience bringing new products and
        businesses to life — in every shape and size.
      </p>
      <p>
        I co-founded <strong>Shandy Shack</strong>, an award-winning
        British craft drinks brand I grew from a festival pop-up to a
        seven-figure acquisition. I lead product and operations at
        <strong>Zeti</strong>, a London fintech building the
        infrastructure for the next generation of asset finance. And
        before that, I spent three years at <strong>Accenture Song</strong>
        advising international businesses on digital strategy and
        innovation.
      </p>
      <p>
        What ties it all together is a genuine love of building things
        from scratch — and the discipline to see them through.
      </p>
      <p>
        Outside work, I travel as much as I can (particularly around the
        less-visited corners of Western Europe), stay active with
        friends, and watch a lot of Spanish cinema.
      </p>
    </div>

    <dl class="about__meta">
      <div>
        <dt class="mono-label">Based</dt>
        <dd>Herne Hill, London</dd>
      </div>
      <div>
        <dt class="mono-label">Languages</dt>
        <dd>English, French, Spanish, Catalan</dd>
      </div>
      <div>
        <dt class="mono-label">Education</dt>
        <dd>BA Modern Languages, Durham</dd>
      </div>
    </dl>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about__sep {
    color: var(--ink-4);
  }

  .section__title em.serif-italic {
    color: var(--ink);
  }

  .about__body {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--s-5);
    font-size: var(--fs-md);
    color: var(--ink-2);
    max-width: 60ch;
    margin-bottom: var(--s-8);
  }

  .about__meta {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: var(--s-5);
    margin: 0;
    padding-top: var(--s-6);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  @media (min-width: 640px) {
    .about__meta {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: var(--s-6);
    }
  }

  .about__meta dt {
    margin-bottom: var(--s-2);
  }

  .about__meta dd {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: var(--fs-base);
    color: var(--ink);
  }
</style>
